  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "So Convenient! No need to cross busy highways to access the beach! This house is only 100 yards-see photos for visual. It is Walkable to BEACH—COFFEE_DONUTS-SANDWICH SHOP-ICE CREAM-SUSHI- URGENT CARE-Just 25 minutes from PCB airport! ✈️✈️✈️ Rent bikes to ride along the gulf front roads to Rosemary Beach.<br><br>Views where your want them in the Main living/dining area on the top floor with walkout balcony and views of gulf! ELEVATOR ACCESS TO ALL FLOORS. <br><br>6 Total sleeping areas- <br>3 King bedrooms<br>1 Queen bedroom <br>XL Huge Bunk Room with 4 twins and 2 full beds with its on walkout balcony on 2nd floor<br>Front entry room- 2 twins (daybed with trundle underneath counted as 6th sleeping area-can be closed off by only using side entrance for entry/exit)<br>Sleeps up to 16<br><br>TWO public beach accesses with one being just 300 steps away! <br>Enjoy the spectacular gulf views from the balconies of this stunning 3 story home in Inlet Beach, FL. Fabulously located between Camp Helen State Park and Rosemary Beach without the crowds! 10 miles to Panama City's Pier Park, 1.8 miles to Publix. Short Walk to the beach without crossing major roads! 5 minute bike ride or drive to shops at Rosemary and Alys Beach. <br><br>This home includes an elevator, 12 ft. ceilings, 3 covered balconies, wraparound front porch with 2 bedswings, large claw foot tub in master bathroom, exterior shower, Parking for 4 cars and just a 2 minute walk to two different public beach access areas. This home is in a prime location to Rosemary Beach and the 30A casual and fine dining restaurants, shops and entertainment. PLENTY of room for large families and entertaining! Gourmet kitchen has a gas stove, granite countertops, breakfast bar and stainless steel appliances. <br><br>Details of sleeping areas on each floor:<br>1st floor-2 King bedrooms with attached baths along with overflow daybed with trundle (sleeping for 6 on the 1st floor with 2 baths)<br><br>2nd floor-1 king bedroom, 1 queen bedroom and a huge xl bunkroom with 4 twin beds/ 2 full. 2nd floor sleeps 10-12 and includes 2 large bathrooms.<br><br>Top floor is the living area- kitchen, living area, 1/2 bath and balcony. (No sleeping on top floor)<br><br>Elevator access to all floors. <br><br>Close to Rosemary Beach, Camp Helen State Park, Carillon, Pier Park and Airport <br><br>Room for 4 cars <br><br>Any Pets must be approved and an extra pet fee of $50 nightly will apply.…",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Multifamily Paradise: Elevator, Gulf Sunset Views, 100 yards to Public Beaches"
        }
