        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Our large group enjoyed the spacious home and the great location! The small fridge on the first floor and the keurig on the first floor were unexpected but such nice amenities for the early riser sleeping downstairs. \nThanks for everything:)",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Great week",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Verified traveler",
        "date": "2020-10-31T22:54:11Z",
        "id": "5f9ca22548a72b12aa16572f",
        "label": "Good",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 8,
        "text": "Great property accurately represented by pictures. 3 levels with roomie bedrooms and spaces. The bunk room sleeps 8 and is super cute. Great for a large group as a pet-friendly space. Easy walk to the beach and exceptional sushi restaurant across the highway. Beautiful view from the top floor living area. You can hear and see the ocean.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Great fall vacation",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Mary G.",
        "date": "2023-06-18T23:01:15Z",
        "id": "648f8cc59195d96d872fafd4",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "This property was awesome for our family to gather and spend time together. The home is located so close to the beach with easy access points. The view from the third floor is incredible as you spend time together. The elevator was wonderful as we had individuals in our party who needed an option besides the stairs. The house manager was extremely responsive and always available to answer questions.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Inlet Beach Father's Day Weekend 2023",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Katherine G.",
        "date": "2023-08-13T19:38:31Z",
        "id": "64d9313c1343e5594587a0d0",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "This house is amazing!! It fit 11 of us really well, the bunk room is huge and could easily fit 6+ people. The balcony on the top floor = WOW! It was the perfect hangout spot with great breeze and sea views!! Every room was gorgeous, great beds, big kitchen, and the elevator was great for suitcases and groceries. Cannot recommend more!! Such an easy walk to the beach, short drive to Seaside and Destin!! We look forward to coming back next year.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Amazing Beach House!!",
        "verified": true
      }
    ],
